      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>A grabbed creature that is reduced to zero hit points or dying must make a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:27] save or have its head removed. At dying 4 head removal is automatic. This is also the fate of any creature left behind after combat. After combat these skulls will be impaled on the stinger of the skull ripper, held in place by barbed serrations.</p>",
          "gm": ""
